ios-redfin bridge patch 0139: retain render-owned argument tables without locking
Ported from steelbrain/metal2vulkan commit 86b5d6faf31986b50b0d2b86525eb61d2e0a3379.
Original author: Anees Iqbal; GPL-2.0-or-later OR LGPL-3.0-or-later.

Render encoders exclusively borrow their stage tables. Use Mutex::get_mut there;
shared callers keep locking. Both paths preserve the existing retention algorithm.

